{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the shores of The Archipelago! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take the role of a sea-plane delivery pilot, with the task of bringing warmth, connection, and care to a sunlit island community. Fly your sea-plane between sparkling seas and open skies, delivering packages that carry stories of love, family, and friendship. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet the quirky locals of each island, uncover hidden treasures, and learn more about your grandfather whose steady hands and big heart once guided the same delivery route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987400/extras/8aa020fe8301eb1f25b4caec6f750858.avif?t=1772655923\" width=1560 height=355 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly a responsive seaplane that glides through the air and across the water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming island residents, each with their own stories to share.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hidden treasures scattered across The Archipelago.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver packages that connect lovers, families, and local businesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story of Ray, your gruff but loving grandfather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted open world packed with a variety of welcoming islands, each with its own personality and challenges.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987400?t=1772655923","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987400?t=1772655923","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987400/b0c719a724ee5241fb40816524f772027c6b9e94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772655923","capsule_image